        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig Deep</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start digging through thick layers of snow in the arctic wilderness. The deeper you go, the more valuable ores and hidden trading card packs you’ll uncover. Upgrade your gear and keep digging, who knows what treasures are buried below?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/dd413bc19895fe2e6d0cec72328739fb.poster.avif?t=1764524880\" width=616 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/dd413bc19895fe2e6d0cec72328739fb.webm?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/dd413bc19895fe2e6d0cec72328739fb.mp4?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Produce New Products &amp; Sell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the resources you find underground into useful items. Merge them in your crafting machine to create better, more valuable products. Sell what you make and keep expanding your snowy workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/3f4915eeff2f0a3fc1d24721ca22e77e.poster.avif?t=1764524880\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/3f4915eeff2f0a3fc1d24721ca22e77e.webm?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/3f4915eeff2f0a3fc1d24721ca22e77e.mp4?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Trading Card Collection or Sell them to earn money</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper, you’ll uncover hidden trading card packs buried in the snow. Open them to find unique cards and grow your collection. Each pack holds surprises, common cards, rare ones, and even shiny collectibles. Complete full sets to show off your collection. Some special feature cards also give powerful boosts to help you dig faster, craft better, or earn more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/89695d4b87f14b89a01ece4f5556842c.poster.avif?t=1764524880\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/89695d4b87f14b89a01ece4f5556842c.webm?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/89695d4b87f14b89a01ece4f5556842c.mp4?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sell Products &amp; Expand Your Area</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the items you craft to passing penguin customers arriving by boat. Use your profits to upgrade machines, unlock new zones, and expand your snowy base. The bigger your operation, the more fun and chaos you’ll manage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/92e7fc809f7750b68129d2ae64ebcc82.poster.avif?t=1764524880\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/92e7fc809f7750b68129d2ae64ebcc82.webm?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/92e7fc809f7750b68129d2ae64ebcc82.mp4?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig Deep</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start digging through thick layers of snow in the arctic wilderness. The deeper you go, the more valuable ores and hidden trading card packs you’ll uncover. Upgrade your gear and keep digging, who knows what treasures are buried below?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/dd413bc19895fe2e6d0cec72328739fb.poster.avif?t=1764524880\" width=616 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/dd413bc19895fe2e6d0cec72328739fb.webm?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/dd413bc19895fe2e6d0cec72328739fb.mp4?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Produce New Products &amp; Sell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the resources you find underground into useful items. Merge them in your crafting machine to create better, more valuable products. Sell what you make and keep expanding your snowy workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/3f4915eeff2f0a3fc1d24721ca22e77e.poster.avif?t=1764524880\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/3f4915eeff2f0a3fc1d24721ca22e77e.webm?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/3f4915eeff2f0a3fc1d24721ca22e77e.mp4?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Trading Card Collection or Sell them to earn money</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper, you’ll uncover hidden trading card packs buried in the snow. Open them to find unique cards and grow your collection. Each pack holds surprises, common cards, rare ones, and even shiny collectibles. Complete full sets to show off your collection. Some special feature cards also give powerful boosts to help you dig faster, craft better, or earn more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/89695d4b87f14b89a01ece4f5556842c.poster.avif?t=1764524880\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/89695d4b87f14b89a01ece4f5556842c.webm?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/89695d4b87f14b89a01ece4f5556842c.mp4?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sell Products &amp; Expand Your Area</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the items you craft to passing penguin customers arriving by boat. Use your profits to upgrade machines, unlock new zones, and expand your snowy base. The bigger your operation, the more fun and chaos you’ll manage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/92e7fc809f7750b68129d2ae64ebcc82.poster.avif?t=1764524880\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/92e7fc809f7750b68129d2ae64ebcc82.webm?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914720/extras/92e7fc809f7750b68129d2ae64ebcc82.mp4?t=1764524880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "This limited version offers a taste of the full game. A cozy simulation sneak peek where you start digging through the arctic to discover ores and trading card packs. Try out early item production, basic upgrades, and meet your first penguin helpers. More features will come in the full version!",
